# Infrastructure Specifications

## Lab Environment
1. Domain Controller
   - Name: dns1.maxtec.be
   - IP: 192.168.0.2
   - Role: Primary DC

2. Workstations
   - Primary: ws-compta-01.maxtec.be
   - Secondary: ws-compta-02.maxtec.be
   - Network: 192.168.0.x

## Hardware Requirements
- Student machines: 32GB RAM
- Windows Server 2022
- VirtualBox with PAE/NX enabled

## Network Structure
1. DNS Structure
   - Root domain: maxtec.be
   - Workstations: flat DNS (directly under root)
   - Format: ws-[dept]-[##].maxtec.be

2. IP Addressing
   - Lab environment: 192.168.0.x
   - Production scheme (for reference only):
     * EU zone: 192.168.10.0/24
     * US zone: 192.168.20.0/24
     * Dev: 192.168.30.0/24
     * Prod: 192.168.40.0/24

## Implementation Notes
- Use simplified lab setup for exercises
- Reference: diagrams/structure_reseau_geographic_zones.drawio
- Complex scenarios shown in theory only


